{"id":"620117fc884bad92","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-levin-random-degrees.md","title":"连续可计算测度保持随机性的非零Turing度","display":"thm-levin-random-degrees — 连续可计算测度保持随机性的非零Turing度","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-levin-random-degrees","aliases":["43-thm-levin-random-degrees"],"display":"thm-levin-random-degrees — 连续可计算测度保持随机性的非零Turing度","depends_on":["[[43-df-compmeasure]]","[[43-df-measure-atoms]]","[[43-df-mlrandom-nu]]","[[43-df-mlrandom]]","[[43-df-turing-red]]","[[43-df-computable]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§9.9.2 Theorem 9.9.8(iii)，印刷200–201，PDF220–221","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-levin-random-degrees"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-levin-random-degrees</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-levin-random-degrees — 连续可计算测度保持随机性的非零Turing度"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8abc268dbc50df5d\" href=\"?note=8abc268dbc50df5d\" title=\"43-df-compmeasure\">43-df-compmeasure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6b32588f9bb461b3\" href=\"?note=6b32588f9bb461b3\" title=\"43-df-measure-atoms\">43-df-measure-atoms</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2ba9a251dffb583e\" href=\"?note=2ba9a251dffb583e\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom-nu\">43-df-mlrandom-nu</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§9.9.2 Theorem 9.9.8(iii)，印刷200–201，PDF220–221"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\">\\(\\nu\\)</span> 为可计算Borel概率测度且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ContinuousMeasure}(\\nu)\">\\(\\operatorname{ContinuousMeasure}(\\nu)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in2^\\omega\">\\(A\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_T\">\\(\\equiv_T\\)</span> 按二进制序列与特征集合识别解释；相关定义见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8abc268dbc50df5d\" href=\"?note=8abc268dbc50df5d\" title=\"43-df-compmeasure\">43-df-compmeasure</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"6b32588f9bb461b3\" href=\"?note=6b32588f9bb461b3\" title=\"43-df-measure-atoms\">43-df-measure-atoms</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"2ba9a251dffb583e\" href=\"?note=2ba9a251dffb583e\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom-nu\">43-df-mlrandom-nu</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\operatorname{TotalComputable}(A)\\Rightarrow\\left(\\left(\\exists X\\in2^\\omega\\;[X\\equiv_T A\\land\\operatorname{MLRandom}(X)]\\right)\\iff\\left(\\exists Y\\in2^\\omega\\;[Y\\equiv_T A\\land\\operatorname{MLRandom}_\\nu(Y)]\\right)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\operatorname{TotalComputable}(A)\\Rightarrow\\left(\\left(\\exists X\\in2^\\omega\\;[X\\equiv_T A\\land\\operatorname{MLRandom}(X)]\\right)\\iff\\left(\\exists Y\\in2^\\omega\\;[Y\\equiv_T A\\land\\operatorname{MLRandom}_\\nu(Y)]\\right)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是度的刻画，未声称同一个二进制序列在两测度下同时随机。原书通过测度对应的区间表示把检验双向搬运，在非原子分支保留计算度；连续性和非零度条件均已保留。本次核对Theorem 9.9.8(iii)的陈述及适用条件，未把原书表示引理和双向检验构造的全部细节记作已核验的证明。</p>\n<p>来源：§9.9.2 Theorem 9.9.8(iii)，印刷200–201，PDF220–221。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地推广或推论已单独注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-compmeasure","status":"resolved","id":"8abc268dbc50df5d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-compmeasure]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-measure-atoms","status":"resolved","id":"6b32588f9bb461b3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-measure-atoms]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mlrandom-nu","status":"resolved","id":"2ba9a251dffb583e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-mlrandom-nu]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-mlrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anch